    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501910/extras/c1ee124362ffa826cdf933099c46f5de.avif?t=1609373506\" /></div><br><br>Fox Stories is a co-op adventure game with focus on exploration and wrecking havoc in the forest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You are a cute fox</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactivity! Grab and throw objects and things on your friends and things. Throw a fish or crab at someone you don't like</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play minigames such as Basketball and racing that can be enjoyed with friends competitively</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Quests and missions that unlock new items and abilities</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achievements unlock rewards that allow you to customize your character</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501910/extras/c1ee124362ffa826cdf933099c46f5de.avif?t=1609373506\" /></div><br><br>Fox Stories is a co-op adventure game with focus on exploration and wrecking havoc in the forest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You are a cute fox</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactivity! Grab and throw objects and things on your friends and things. Throw a fish or crab at someone you don't like</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play minigames such as Basketball and racing that can be enjoyed with friends competitively</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Quests and missions that unlock new items and abilities</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achievements unlock rewards that allow you to customize your character</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fox Stories is a co-op sandbox game where you get to be a fox with your friends, wreaking havoc in an open to exploration forest.",
